# The order of the operations in one full cycle. Read by "blueprint activity".
name Full round trip

start S
action A1 : Run the compiler front end over the translation unit
action A2 : Read the abstract syntax tree into the model
decision D1 : Does any classifier carry the persistent stereotype
action A3 : Emit the class diagram in both notations
action A4 : Derive the relational schema
action A5 : Generate the class skeletons from the schema
action A6 : Extract a model from the generated skeletons
action A7 : Read the diagram back into a model
action A8 : Compare the two models
decision D2 : Do the two models agree
action A9 : Report the drift and fail the build
action A10 : Report the round trip as closed
end E

S -> A1
A1 -> A2
A2 -> D1
D1 -> A4 : yes
D1 -> A3 : no
A4 -> A5
A5 -> A6
A6 -> A8
A3 -> A7
A7 -> A8
A8 -> D2
D2 -> A10 : yes
D2 -> A9 : no
A9 -> E
A10 -> E
